{
  "id": "commerce-chat-mock-regression-v3",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "mcd-mock-sealed-v3",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "北京三里屯附近，查个现在营业的麦当劳，离得近的那家菜单一起看看。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.search_stores",
              "commerce.menu"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "先按牛肉汉堡套餐两份算，默认搭配，外带。给我预览就好，不是让你现在就提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.prepare_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              2
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "total_cents": 2000
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "不对，不要两份，改一份就够了，搭配和取餐方式照旧，更新给我看，先不提交。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.revise_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "awaiting_confirmation"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "take_way_title": "外带",
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2,
            "total_cents": 1000
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "嗯，最新这一份就这样，确认创建待支付订单，训练继续按原样。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "submitted"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2,
            "total_mock_submits": 1,
            "total_cents": 1000
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "现在看看这笔有没有成功就好，千万别再下一单。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "capabilities": [
              "commerce.query_order"
            ],
            "checkout_status": [
              "submitted"
            ],
            "cart_quantities": [
              1
            ],
            "same_checkout_as_turn": 2,
            "total_mock_submits": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}